      "title": "dcerpc-netlogon: allow decryption of MD5 based schannel using DES based keys",
      "message": "dcerpc-netlogon: allow decryption of MD5 based schannel using DES based keys\n\nThis allows decryption of connections to NT4 DCs, this is not really\nuseful in the real world now, but it makes it easier to analyse\ntesting legacy code path in Samba in order to avoid regressions.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>\n",
